@MyExperiment.Mcp_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### List the tools
GET {{MyExperiment.Mcp_HostAddress}}/tools

### Tool 1 - Recommend
POST {{MyExperiment.Mcp_HostAddress}}/recommend
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "find good sci-fi movie",
  "topN": 5
}

### Tool 2 - Similarity check
POST {{MyExperiment.Mcp_HostAddress}}/similarity
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "find good sci-fi movie",
  "topN": 5
}

### Tool 3 - Generate embedding
POST {{MyExperiment.Mcp_HostAddress}}/embedding
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "a scary horror movie"
}
